\/td><td>Automation + CRM&nbsp;<\/td><td>Advanced follow-ups&nbsp;<\/td><\/tr><tr><td><strong><a href=\"https:\/\/calendly.com\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener nofollow\">Calendly<\/a><\/strong><\/td><td>Appointment booking&nbsp;<\/td><td>Consultations and demos&nbsp;<\/td><\/tr><tr><td><strong><a href=\"https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/business\/ads\/ad-objectives\/lead-generation\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener nofollow\">Meta&nbsp;Lead&nbsp;Ads<\/a><\/strong><\/td><td>In-app lead capture&nbsp;<\/td><td>Social media leads&nbsp;<\/td><\/tr><tr><td><strong><a href=\"https:\/\/marketingplatform.google.com\/about\/analytics\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener nofollow\">Google Analytics<\/a><\/strong><\/td><td>Lead tracking insights&nbsp;<\/td><td>Performance analysis&nbsp;<\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Lead Generation in Digital&nbsp;Marketing: Example<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p>Imagine you&nbsp;run&nbsp;a <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/how-to-start-digital-marketing-agency\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">digital marketing agency<\/a>. You publish a blog titled &#8220;How Local Businesses Can Get More Enquiries Online.&#8221; Inside the blog, you offer a free website audit.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>A visitor reads the blog, clicks the CTA,&nbsp;fills&nbsp;a form with name and phone number, and receives an instant WhatsApp confirmation. You call them within 10 minutes, understand their&nbsp;requirement, and schedule a detailed consultation.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Over the next few days, you&nbsp;share&nbsp;case studies and pricing. The lead converts into a client. This is digital marketing&nbsp;lead&nbsp;generation working end to end\u2014from content to conversion.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Lead Generation in Digital Marketing: Video Guide<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<iframe loading=\"lazy\" width=\"640\" height=\"350\" src=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/embed\/fRN9dWLy1R8?si=2-K8L8MUzQB_c18a\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" allowfullscreen><\/iframe>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">FAQs About Lead Generation&nbsp;in Digital Marketing<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"schema-faq wp-block-yoast-faq-block\"><div class=\"schema-faq-section\" id=\"faq-question-1782730610041\"><strong class=\"schema-faq-question\">1. What are\u00a0leads\u00a0in marketing?<\/strong> <p class=\"schema-faq-answer\">Leads are people who show interest by taking\u00a0an action\u00a0like\u00a0filling\u00a0a form, calling, or signing up.<\/p> <\/div> <div class=\"schema-faq-section\" id=\"faq-question-1782730619308\"><strong class=\"schema-faq-question\">2. What is\u00a0lead\u00a0generation in sales?<\/strong> <p class=\"schema-faq-answer\">It is the process of\u00a0identifying\u00a0and converting interested prospects into customers through follow-ups and closing.<\/p> <\/div> <div class=\"schema-faq-section\" id=\"faq-question-1782730631246\"><strong class=\"schema-faq-question\">3. What is\u00a0lead\u00a0generation in digital marketing?<\/strong> <p class=\"schema-faq-answer\">Lead generation in digital marketing is the process of attracting potential customers through online channels like SEO, social media, paid ads, and email and capturing their contact details to convert them into paying customers.<\/p> <\/div> <div class=\"schema-faq-section\" id=\"faq-question-1782730644843\"><strong class=\"schema-faq-question\">4. What is the difference between traffic and leads?<\/strong> <p class=\"schema-faq-answer\">Traffic is visitors; leads are visitors who share their contact details and signal intent to buy.<\/p> <\/div> <div class=\"schema-faq-section\" id=\"faq-question-1782730660975\"><strong class=\"schema-faq-question\">5. How does digital marketing\u00a0help in\u00a0lead generation?<\/strong> <p class=\"schema-faq-answer\">Digital marketing helps in lead generation by giving you targeted channels like SEO, paid ads, email, and social media to reach the right audience, capture their details, and move them through the sales funnel efficiently.<\/p> <\/div> <div class=\"schema-faq-section\" id=\"faq-question-1782730673561\"><strong class=\"schema-faq-question\">6. How to generate leads without ads?<\/strong> <p class=\"schema-faq-answer\">Use SEO blogs, referrals, partnerships, and social media content. Organic digital marketing lead generation is cost-effective and builds a long-term pipeline without ad spend.<\/p> <\/div> <div class=\"schema-faq-section\" id=\"faq-question-1782730697732\"><strong class=\"schema-faq-question\">7. What is the difference between MQL and SQL?<\/strong> <p class=\"schema-faq-answer\">An MQL (Marketing Qualified Lead) has engaged with your content but is not yet\u00a0sales-ready. An SQL (Sales Qualified Lead) has shown clear buying intent and is ready for a direct sales conversation.<\/p> <\/div> <div class=\"schema-faq-section\" id=\"faq-question-1782730710751\"><strong class=\"schema-faq-question\">8. What is the role of a landing page in lead generation?<\/strong> <p class=\"schema-faq-answer\">A landing page is where visitors convert into leads. It presents a single offer with a clear CTA and a short form, removing\u00a0distractions\u00a0so the visitor takes one focused action.<\/p> <\/div> <div class=\"schema-faq-section\" id=\"faq-question-1782730734993\"><strong class=\"schema-faq-question\">9. How do you measure the success of lead generation?<\/strong> <p class=\"schema-faq-answer\">Track metrics like\u00a0number\u00a0of leads generated, lead-to-conversion rate, cost per lead, and lead source performance.\u00a0These tell\u00a0you what is working and where to improve.<\/p> <\/div> <div class=\"schema-faq-section\" id=\"faq-question-1782730749254\"><strong class=\"schema-faq-question\">10. What is the difference between inbound and outbound lead generation?<\/strong> <p class=\"schema-faq-answer\">Inbound lead generation attracts customers through content, SEO, and social media. Outbound involves proactive outreach like cold calls, cold emails, and paid ads to reach prospects directly.<\/p> <\/div> <div class=\"schema-faq-section\" id=\"faq-question-1782730763054\"><strong class=\"schema-faq-question\">11. What is B2B lead generation?<\/strong> <p class=\"schema-faq-answer\">B2B lead generation focuses on attracting leads from other businesses, typically using LinkedIn, email outreach, webinars, and content marketing rather than mass consumer channels.<\/p> <\/div> <\/div>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\">\n<figure class=\"aligncenter size-full\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/digital-marketing-course?utm_source=WsBlog&amp;utm_medium=Content_Banner&amp;utm_campaign=SEO&amp;utm_page=\/lead-generation-in-digital-marketing\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\" noreferrer noopener\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1546\" height=\"380\" src=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/online-digital-marketing-course.webp\" alt=\"Online Digital Marketing Course\" class=\"wp-image-14520\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/online-digital-marketing-course.webp 1546w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/online-digital-marketing-course-300x74.webp 300w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/online-digital-marketing-course-1024x252.webp 1024w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/online-digital-marketing-course-768x189.webp 768w, https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/online-digital-marketing-course-1536x378.webp 1536w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1546px) 100vw, 1546px\" \/><\/a><\/figure>\n<\/div>\n\n\n<p class=\"has-white-color has-vivid-cyan-blue-background-color has-text-color 